{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/qbuuce3i50yndeqvq9knyz7r455uug9.mp3","text":"我会把这些都安排好的，交给我吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/covfwm950wjb7689yq8h6qpf5gd25eh.mp3","text":"希望在我忙着处理博士你安排的事务时，组里的其他人不要闹出什么岔子......啊啊啊......一想到这件事，就开始心慌了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/52/h81lyzl1m91svfa3qkzk7ltt2qt3hiz.mp3","text":"平静的工作，平静的生活，我想过的也就是这样的日子而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/jma6kc5rbypyam9gzvuzl67wzx2alkv.mp3","text":"别说了，我不是不擅长和行动预备组A6的其他队员相处，我是看到他们就头疼......","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/3yb81y6690km1rsn7lnynp3yvmpnubg.mp3","text":"......组里的其他人每天都在惹麻烦，有自闭的，听不懂话的，屡教不改的......要到哪一天大家才会安稳工作啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_007.mp3","text":"我也不知道自己为什么会被分到这个小组......明明只是想要普普通通地生活的我，为什么要照顾这些问题儿童啊？！不对，月见夜根本不是儿童！"},{"url":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_008.mp3","text":"泡普卡，摸摸她......空爆，绑起来......斑点，别让他生气......月见夜，直接砸晕带走......这样博士你......就也知道怎么去应对A6小组的其他人了......"},{"url":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_009.mp3","text":"博士要尝尝吗？这些是我自己做的蛋糕，我正准备拿去分给小组里的其他成员，他们最喜欢水果蛋糕了。其实，A6的各位就是群小孩子而已嘛......"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/1u24hkjbny9sr7efje0pxskoy7xj2hw.mp3","text":"今天已经不剩多少时间了，您今天的任务完成了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/hdnqmujtqo10vgi10r9elw1q3wg9940.mp3","text":"预备行动组A6的组长，梓兰，前来报到。您就是博士吗，接下来的工作请多多关照。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/d04f4gwi9xaf69cbwhjieqvxvgl5i7k.mp3","text":"真是让人受益匪浅的录像，我会好好记下来的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/otcbva241zyvq3jzmhcyp2ler1ni9gr.mp3","text":"十分感谢，之后我也会努力提高自己，为博士争取更好的业绩！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/ox3crd2a49op42lh9p3cciw8fz2218o.mp3","text":"我会好好完成我的任务的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/n3wcuhh0bm29081te3rwuh0vjk8c4kv.mp3","text":"请各位严格遵循战术手册行事，谢谢配合！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/cmgm6l8n81yqkn9kc1gkcf1sn6s7cn8.mp3","text":"战斗开始！大家请小心！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/e8koj7571e6lrnxcpnbc0uf42sid3vr.mp3","text":"请大家务必要按照计划执行任务！全体人员散开！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/223nm3e1kkxzd1wn19yclopr7zyvqr1.mp3","text":"请说！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/4ppmv7l3kgd59ggysnd7pkkypl2oorc.mp3","text":"在！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/8sw9kvucwhmleqouj1jtqg2p3nabuaf.mp3","text":"梓兰，准备就绪。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/49/srxfp09rajrbuty9e09ekd1vcyau4un.mp3","text":"一切按计划进行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/2crmekx50bteaehm380ck7hezvtzvnk.mp3","text":"目标锁定！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/34/1x51nuhtcg6jfl9x0lk9tdrdjh6x9bb.mp3","text":"阻止敌人的脚步！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/85/ozie28thgjbob1u8euk7oapnfv99l3d.mp3","text":"别烦我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/lxopjjvcstqf48xud6uoerfgujaf0lp.mp3","text":"工作已经够多了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/90vet7gkknqyd7rqbux88nmw4rxpywb.mp3","text":"不愧是博士，即使是面对这样的敌人，作战指挥也是如此完美。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/jsknc3n2sf735ljg314lbjnznzjfy2a.mp3","text":"完美完成了工作！看来今天可以好好休息一下了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/nlwrmnh5funmhcfrdiz2q1jiu3l9jxf.mp3","text":"......下次还得更加努力才行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/8492cuq5fzkibxyn5y2qm6byzrmrxb6.mp3","text":"大家都没事吧，我们快离开这里！","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/tkm31r3ru016r432022nva357b4nkkx.mp3","text":"真是吵闹的地方......","alt":"voice_cn/char_278_orchid/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/mcpme